1
00:00:00,560 --> 00:00:02,130
(Penny:)Yeah, it's true.
Amy told me.

2
00:00:02,130 --> 00:00:04,000
(Raj:)How did that even happen?

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:05,630
(Raj:)Did they know that's
what they were doing

4
00:00:05,630 --> 00:00:07,870
(Raj:)when they were doing it?

5
00:00:07,870 --> 00:00:10,270
(Penny:)I-I guess they just figured
it out at some point.

6
00:00:10,270 --> 00:00:11,600
(Leonard:)Wow.

7
00:00:11,610 --> 00:00:15,380
(Raj:)I can't believe old
Smelly Pooper finally got laid.

8
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:20,310
(Sheldon:)Hey.
Hey.

9
00:00:20,320 --> 00:00:21,250
(Leonard:)Hope you're hungry.

10
00:00:21,250 --> 00:00:23,720
(Amy:)Interesting.

11
00:00:23,720 --> 00:00:25,990
(Sheldon:)A friendly sentiment
in this country,

12
00:00:25,990 --> 00:00:29,590
(Sheldon:)cruel taunt in the Sudan.

13
00:00:30,420 --> 00:00:33,060
(Sheldon:)It's a lesson in context.

14
00:00:33,060 --> 00:00:35,160
(Leonard:)Will Amy be
joining us for dinner?

15
00:00:35,160 --> 00:00:36,700
(Sheldon:)Yes, I believe so.

16
00:00:36,700 --> 00:00:38,160
(Leonard:)Good, good.

17
00:00:38,170 --> 00:00:41,370
(Raj:)Everything...
okay between you two?

18
00:00:46,570 --> 00:00:48,940
(Greene:)Yes.

19
00:00:48,940 --> 00:00:51,380
(Sheldon:)Why do you ask?

20
00:00:51,380 --> 00:00:53,510
(Leonard:)No reason.

21
00:00:53,520 --> 00:00:55,720
(Leonard:)I was just talking to Raj,

22
00:00:55,720 --> 00:01:00,020
(Leonard:)and he mentioned what a lovely
glow she has these days.

